# <type>(<scope>): <short description>  — 50 chars max, lowercase, no period
# Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, chore, perf
# Scopes: player, library, settings, metadata, subtitles, docs, website, build
# Example: player: show battery and clock in top bar
#          fix: allow Media3-only release build
#          docs: update FAQ with naming guide
#          refactor: simplify metadata to TMDB only
#
# Body (optional, only if needed to avoid confusion) — wrap at 72 chars:
# - What changed, why, not how
# - Keep short, no AI phrases like "No version bump, safe for F-Droid"
#
# Example body:
# - Remove Fanart, OMDb, Wikidata
# - Keep TMDB only for lightness
#
# Footer (optional): Fixes #123, Refs #456
